            <p>American Express has demonstrated substantial long-term value creation for shareholders over the past five decades. From an adjusted close of <strong>${first_price:.2f}</strong> in June 1972 to <strong>${last_price:.2f}</strong> in March 2026, the stock delivered a cumulative return of <strong>{cumulative_return:,.0f}%</strong>.</p>

